           <h1> MASIMONG NON-PROFIT ORGANISATION</h1>
        </span>
   
    <body>
          <h5>VISION</h5>
            <p>
                Masimong non-profit(npo) leads the community towards self-reliance and sustainable development. The main mission of the organization is to organise the community by mobilizing and recruiting people within the community with special regard to the needs of the communities’ men, women, youth, previously disadvantaged individuals and the sick.
            </p>
           <h5>MISSION</h5>
            <p>
                To build effective organization through among others,mobilizing,recruiting and concerting the people of the region with special regard to the needs of communities,women,youth,people with disabilties,the poor,previously disadvantaged individuals and the sick
            </p>
           <h5>Values</h5>
            <ul>
                <li>Respect.</li>
                <li>Humility</li>
                <li>Communication</li>
                <li>Perseverance</li>
                <li>Love</li>
            </ul>
           
              
           <h5>Main Objectives</h5>
           <p>
               To promote and advance effective empowerment and capacity building of it's leaders, members and community at large,through projects, programs,campaings,education and training.To co-operate with those progressive organs of civic society locally,regionally and internationaly which have similar aims and objectives.To establish and promote community projects and co-operations.
           </p>
                
              
